    27	- **Teague's crew:** stays through the cold term at Lowmarch's upper inn: four practitioners plus the older healer of no Path, all unnamed except Teague. His exact term is: `After the thaw. Whatever's on that bearing. My crew comes.` / `Noted.` He has the cold road; the five have the axe-head fence. [B7-reconciled 2026-10-11: amendment 4]
    28	- **The Quieting:** four sites lie on one straight edge of the map. The Ring, Stair and Hall were entered. The fourth was seen and paced from outside at **440 yards and two strides** radius, behind registry-iron stake 34 repeated one per pace. It is unentered, unnamed, undated and untested; its grey central upright is unresolved and its effect unknown. `Someone made this pattern.` was said once and not answered. [B7-reconciled 2026-10-11: amendment 4]
    29	- **Pike/the Compact:** Pike has nine completed lines under the five names; the ninth is the Stair and reads *three hundred; taken; not paid*. The first-snow season line is written with no number against it. The five names remain **eleventh**. The Compact has a Fallow completion report, the Stair rim's observations and a clerk's packet saying the crew kept the kit; it does not know that fragments work inside. [B7-reconciled 2026-10-11: amendment 4] It has reached across the Line twice: on paper (the Fallow completion report) and in person (the six on the Stair's rim). The asset-restriction is pending. **Vastin is still inside**, writing nothing, with one window in Book 7. [B7-reconciled 2026-10-11: coordinator ruling] (restored: entry content the amendment's replacement had dropped)
    30	- **Who knows the integration mechanism:** Cael, Lira, Brom, Karis, Seln and Oryn — six. Oryn knows sources by Path and not by person except those she has touched; she does not know Seln supplied Shadow-adjacent. **Not** Vastin, Teague, Pike or Cleon. All six know the still-place phenomenon; only Cael and Oryn are shown hearing/saying its label. Cael, Lira, Brom, Karis and Seln know the fourth-site survey; Oryn, Teague and Pike do not know that result at entry. [B7-reconciled 2026-10-11: amendment 4]
