editions/monroe-1.3/book-04-copper-crown/manuscript/chapter-21.md-142-
editions/monroe-1.3/book-04-copper-crown/manuscript/chapter-21.md:143:*Wind-adjacent. Ceiling on sprung timber: four free, fifth billed. On stone: three free. Landing beat the length it has always been. Never shortened.*
