    48	
    49	"So there's three ways through that gate in this loft," said Lira. "And we're not using one of them."
    50	
    51	"We shall use the fourth," said Seln. "I am going to find out what it is. I shall be some hours, and nobody is to go above the trough while I am gone."
    52	
    53	"And I am to sit in a hayloft," said Karis, "two hundred yards beneath it."
    54	
    55	"You are to sit in a hayloft and not be written down. It is harder than it sounds. I have done it for most of my life."
