    92	
    93	"Three," Cael heard him say, to a load of firewood. "Three. Go on."
    94	
    95	A girl came up with a basket of eggs. She had a card. The keeper read it, and shook his head, and tapped the card with his pen.
    96	
    97	"That's the forenoon's. It's past the bell."
    98	
    99	She said something that Cael could not hear, quickly, with her chin up.
   100	
