editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-006/review-editorial.stdout.log:3139:  above an unnamed valley; a cart and a horse; **Karis's three boxes and Seln's case under one
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-006/review-editorial.stdout.log:3140:  canvas** (Seln's case rides on Seln when walking — B7). Book 7 Ch1's log opens "Second day past
