editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-004/recheck-r2.stdout.log:11140:editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-003/source-tracking.stdout.log-1207-    16	4. He drafts a petition for standing: the senior evaluator who personally assessed the subject asks leave to submit a finding. Two provisions, both old; the older one from before the standardizing, which uses *shall receive*. He cites both; a petition on one leg deserves to fall. He sets out his history from memory: four supplementary findings in forty years, four granted, each received and weighed — one decisive against the petitioning district's own case, and the district wrote to thank him. He predicts: standing within days, a finding entered at the next sitting.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-004/recheck-r2.stdout.log:11144:editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-003/source-tracking.stdout.log-1211-    20	8. He writes the finding anyway that evening, in his own hand, the addressee line left empty. The building's lamp rule (the floor's lamps out at the sixth bell). The clerk's one sentence in nineteen years that is not about the work — his own question (I'll give him: whether the Archmarshal would like the window shut, the pigeons are loud — no: a question that touches the man: "Will you be going home tonight, sir?"). Candle fetched and entered on the consumables under Vastin's name. The finding: the standard protocol cannot measure this subject; its silence is the instrument's limit, not the subject's fault; a re-evaluation whose result is known in advance is a procedure dressed as an evaluation; the honest instrument available is the demonstration record. The hardest page: the instruments are not at fault — the same sentence he has defended all his life for frames, now for a boy. Last paragraph: the schedule's purpose unknown to him; an evaluation that starts from its conclusion evaluates the evaluator. Nine pages. Into his own drawer in the cabinet of shallow drawers, under a heading he never needed before: [P] *Pending a proceeding worth sending it to.*
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-004/recheck-r2.stdout.log:11150:editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-003/source-tracking.stdout.log-1267-    76	1. First light, the coach down; the cases. Karis at the ferry: we'll win on the text; brace for winning feeling like winning. Lira: you said that last time. Karis: I'll say it every time; saying it keeps a finding from rotting into a hope. Brom's pocket; Seln with eyes shut; the counsel adding to her minute. Withrow ahead in her carriage.
